---
import Layout from "@tgwab/ui/Layout.astro";
---

<Layout
  site="ferberme"
  title="Family | Ferber"
  description="Family history, photos, and documents from the Ferber family archive."
  canonical="https://ferber.me/"
>
  <section class="container hero reveal">
    <div class="hero-copy">
      <p class="eyebrow">FERBER.ME</p>
      <h1>About the Ferbers</h1>
      <p class="lede">
        Originally from Germany, the Ferbers came to the great United States of America arriving at
        Ellis Island in the New York Harbor. Their first sight was the newly built Statue of
        Liberty. They settled in Ohio and after some years some migrated to North Carolina.
      </p>
      <p>
        My father, <strong>Thomas Eugene Ferber</strong> (Tom), was the 4th generation Ferber born in
        the United States. Born in Ohio, the family moved to Hickory, NC when he was 5 years old.
        Hickory is where he met my mother, <strong>Gloria Jean Kight</strong>, born in San Gabriel,
        CA. They were highschool sweethearts, and they married in 1971.
      </p>
      <p>
        They had three children: me (1978), Sara (1981), and Rebekah (1984). My dad was a talented
        carpenter, working on remodels and renovations for the majority of his adulthood. He built
        the house our family lived in from the time Rebekah was a newborn until the mid 2000s.
      </p>
    </div>
    <img class="crest surface-card" src="/assets/images/ferber_crest.jpg" alt="Ferber family crest" />
  </section>

  <section class="container reveal" data-delay="1">
    <h2 class="section-title">Family Archive</h2>
    <div class="grid">
      <article class="surface-card card">
        <h3>History</h3>
        <p>Origins, surname history, and the family crest, including the original PDF reference.</p>
        <a class="pill" href="/history/">Open history</a>
      </article>
      <article class="surface-card card">
        <h3>Photos</h3>
        <p>A gallery of Ferber family photos from throughout the years with full-size lightbox viewing.</p>
        <a class="pill" href="/photos/">Browse photos</a>
      </article>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

<style>
  .hero {
    padding: var(--space-16) 0 var(--space-12);
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: minmax(0, 1.4fr) minmax(280px, 0.8fr);
    gap: var(--space-8);
    align-items: start;
  }

  .hero-copy {
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
  }

  .eyebrow {
    text-transform: uppercase;
    letter-spacing: 0.08em;
    color: var(--ink-faint);
    font-size: 0.72rem;
  }

  .lede {
    max-width: 58ch;
  }

  .crest {
    width: 100%;
    object-fit: cover;
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
  }

  .grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(2, minmax(0, 1fr));
    gap: var(--space-8);
  }

  .card {
    padding: var(--space-6);
    display: grid;
    gap: var(--space-4);
    min-height: 15rem;
  }

  .pill {
    width: fit-content;
    text-decoration: none;
    color: var(--ink-soft);
    border: 1px solid var(--line);
    border-radius: var(--radius-pill);
    padding: 0.34rem 0.66rem;
    background: color-mix(in srgb, var(--surface-raised) 72%, transparent);
    margin-top: auto;
  }

  .pill:hover {
    color: var(--ink);
    border-color: color-mix(in srgb, var(--accent) 45%, var(--line));
  }

  @media (max-width: 900px) {
    .hero,
    .grid {
      grid-template-columns: 1fr;
    }
  }
</style>